<Behavior #vendor-data-graph-tui-projection apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" version="1" (
  <Requirements [
    <Requirement #unified-computed-projection (
      <Statement ?01M05F1P47Y52DEWWYG34WVD96>
      TuiA1StateGraph SHALL derive all projection signals through the unified DataGraph computed runtime and preserve projection values, updates, and TUI graph behavior.
      </?01M05F1P47Y52DEWWYG34WVD96>
      <Suites [
        <Suite #tui-projection (
          <Cases [
            <Case #computed-reads [
              <Then ?01M05F1P47Y52DEWWYG34WVD97>
              their getters SHALL use runtime.graph.get and SHALL NOT use ctx.get
              </?01M05F1P47Y52DEWWYG34WVD97>
              <Then ?01M05F1P47Y52DEWWYG34WVD98>
              focused TUI graph and integration tests SHALL pass
              </?01M05F1P47Y52DEWWYG34WVD98>
            ] (
              <Given ?01M05F1P47Y52DEWWYG34WVD99>
              the TUI graph has a snapshot and derived projection signals
